Plan:      shop-lab
Context:   kind-lab
Standby:   kind-standby
Targets:   RTO 30m, RPO 24h
Provider:  kind (name=lab)
Lab only:  yes (drills are allowed)

Stopping (dr down)
  1. prepare    suspend CronJobs in shop
  2. apps       web (tier 2, http http://localhost:8080/healthz) -> api (tier 1, pods ready)
  3. databases  shop-db (cnpg, tier 0)
  4. nodes      cordon and drain the worker nodes
  5. power      power off with kind

Starting (dr up)
  1. power      power on with kind, then wait for the API
  2. nodes      uncordon the nodes that were cordoned
  3. databases  shop-db (cnpg, tier 0)
  4. apps       api (tier 1, pods ready) -> web (tier 2, http http://localhost:8080/healthz)
  5. prepare    resume the CronJobs that were suspended

Confirmation phrases
  dr down (apps and databases)   none (--execute is enough)
  dr down (everything)           "stop kind-lab"
  dr up                          none (--execute is enough)
